  "summary": "This page is about a Japanese fashion style.",
  "description": "This page is about a Japanese fashion style. For the aesthetic based on ball-jointed dolls, see Dollcore . For other aesthetics associated with the word \"doll,\" see Doll (disambiguation) .\n\nIt is important to note that the term \"Dolly Kei\" is only used in reference to this particular fashion outside of Japan while locals use it to describe a doll-like aesthetic in general.",
